[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それじゃあ姉様。私とヤンネ姉様は\n聖戦士の仕事に行ってくるわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well then, Alvina, Big Sis and I are heading out for our Sacred Knight duties."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビちゃんも案内人のお仕事、頑張ってね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Good luck with your Guide work today, Alvie!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょ、ちょっと待った！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-wait a second!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "二人とも、今日は草原地帯の見回りでしょ？\nアタシもついていっていい？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You two are patrolling the grasslands today, right? Can I come along?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "案内人の仕事までまだ時間あるし、\n調合用の素材を採取したいの。お願い！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I've got time before my Guide duties start, and I want to gather some materials for synthesis. Please!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビちゃん。案内人としてのお仕事をしっかりと\nした上でやる分には、口を出さないと言ったけれど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvie, I said I wouldn't interfere as long as you properly fulfill your duties as a Star Guide..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "このあとお仕事があるなら、それに向けた準備をして、\n星の案内人としての天命を果たさなきゃダメよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But if you have work later, you need to prepare for it and fulfill your divine calling as a Star Guide."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まぁ、それもそうなんだけど、よく考えてみて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well yes, but think about it..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なあに？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What is it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシの天命は、星の案内人として観光客に寄り添い、\nこの国の素晴らしさを伝えること",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My divine calling is to guide tourists and share the wonders of our country as a Star Guide."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ、そうね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, that's right."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だからこそ、アタシはこの国のどこでどんな素材が\n採取できるのか、知っておく必要がある！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's exactly why I need to know what materials can be gathered where in this country!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いつか来るかもしれない、錬金術士の観光客のために！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "For any alchemist tourists who might visit someday!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんて意識の高さ……さすが姉様",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Such dedication..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "確かに、アルビちゃんの言う通りかもしれないわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You might have a point there, Alvie."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ二つ約束できる？\n自分のお仕事に遅れないこと。勝手な行動をしないこと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then can you promise me two things? Don't be late for work, and don't act on your own."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "できるできる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I can do that!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様のことは私が守るわ。任せて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll protect her. You can count on me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヤンネ姉様。ここは何も問題なさそうだわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Big Sis, everything seems clear here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ。アタシ、ちょっと向こうで採取をしてもいい？\nそこにある薬草が欲しかったんだよね～",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh! Can I gather materials over there? I really want those herbs..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "待ってアルビちゃん。そっちはこの間\n魔物の目撃情報があったから、私が先に行くわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait, Alvie! There were monster sightings in that area recently. Let me scout it out first."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大丈夫！\u3000パッと見、魔物も人もいないし、\nちょっと採取してすぐ戻って来るから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's fine! I don't see any monsters or people around. I'll just grab some materials and be right back!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビちゃん、止まって！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Watch out!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うわあっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eek!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はぁっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様、大丈夫！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina, are you alright?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "う、うん。大丈夫……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-yeah, I'm fine..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとう、ヤンネおねーちゃん。\n……ごめん。魔物がいるの、気が付かなくて……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you, Big Sis... Sorry, I wasn't paying attention..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もうっ、アルビちゃんのバカ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geez, you dummy!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "バ、バカ！？\u3000ヤンネおねーちゃんのその叱り方、\nひっさしぶりに聞いた……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "D-dummy?! It's been ages since you've called me that..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "魔物の目撃情報があったから、私が先に行くって\n言ったじゃない……ほんと、肝が冷えたわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I told you there were monster sightings and that I'd check ahead first... You nearly gave me a heart attack!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビちゃんにケガがなくてよかった。\nでも、勝手な行動をしたことには怒ってるわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm glad you're not hurt, but you shouldn't have went ahead alone."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、その構えは……！\nごめんなさーい！\u3000それだけはー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "N-not that stance...! I'm sorry! Anything but that!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こら！\u3000待ちなさいアルビちゃん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Get back here, Alvie!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様から聞いたことあるわ。\nこれが、泣く子も黙る、ヤンネ姉様のお尻百叩き……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I've heard about this from Alvina... This must be Big Sis' legendary hundred spankings that even crying children fall silent before...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "聖戦士さん！\u3000魔物が出たんですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sacred Knight! Were there monsters about?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "通りすがりの男",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Passing Man"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。でも、もう大丈夫。\nヤンネ姉様が倒してくれたから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, but everything's fine now. Big Sis took care of it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふん、すごいでしょ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, pretty amazing, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もう、なんでアルビちゃんが自慢げなの。ふふ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geez, why are you the one looking proud? Hehe."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さすがヤンネさん！\u3000ありがとうございます。\n星の導きに感謝を。それでは私はこれで",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you so much, Lady Janne. Praise be to the stars' guidance. I'll take my leave now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "通りすがりの男",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Passing Man"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシもそろそろ仕事に行かなきゃかな。\nそれじゃ、二人とも、また夜に家で！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I should head to work soon too. See you both at home tonight!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お仕事頑張ってね、姉様",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Good luck with work, Alvina."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "また後でね。\n大丈夫だと思うけれど、無茶はしちゃダメよ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "See you later. I think you'll be fine, but no more reckless behavior, okay?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しないよ！\u3000ヤンネおねーちゃんのお尻百叩きは\nもうこりごりだからね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I won't! I never want to experience Big Sis' hundred spankings again!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]